      "data": {
        "html": "<h1>Summary</h1><p></p><p><mark>Our team wanted to accommodate increasing customer's needs in time series data anomaly detection (tsAD).</mark> I helped the team to define the product scope, establish project lifecycle, and design and test the UI from scratch.</p><p></p><p>The MVP was adopted by 300+ customers, quickly validating our initial direction. This may not be a big number in consumer section, but for a specialized domain, it was a strong signal that we were solving a real customer need.</p><p></p><p>The MVP was adopted by 300+ customers, quickly validating our initial direction. This may not be a big number in consumer section, but for a specialized domain, it was a strong signal that we were solving a real customer need.The MVP was adopted by 300+ customers, quickly validating our initial direction. This may not be a big number in <mark>consumer section, but for a specialized domain, it was a strong signal that we were solving a real customer need.</mark></p>",
