      },
      "data": {
        "html": "<h1>Background</h1><p></p><p>Industrial engineers need to identify anomalous patterns in physical-system data early to prevent equipment failures and reduce operational costs.</p><p></p><p>This need is growing: the global anomaly detection market is estimated at $7–8B in 2026, and our team had also received direct requests from our top customers.</p>",
        "size": "xl"
      },
      "width": 600,
